.TH SCQREF 1.SH NAMEscqref \- quick reference for sc.SH SYNOPSIS\fBscqref\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBscqref\fRprints the quick reference for\fBsc\fR,\fRthe spreadsheet: 360 lines in sections A to Q, covering its options,cursor movement, entering cells, files, ranges and every function.  Pageit with\fBscqref ! more\fR(or\fB| less\fR).\fR.SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR\fBDOC/sc\fRhas sc's full manual and tutorial..SH SEE ALSOsc